# Code owners for hippius-desktop.
#
# The `main` branch ruleset sets `require_code_owner_review`, which is VACUOUS
# without this file: with no owners defined, GitHub has no owner review to
# request and any collaborator's approval satisfies the rule. This file is what
# makes "production changes need a named reviewer" actually true.
#
# GitHub reads CODEOWNERS from the BASE branch of a pull request, so this must
# stay on `main` for PRs into `main` to be gated by it.
#
# Everything, including workflows, release scripts and signing configuration.
